  "description_html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"courseDescription\">\n    Co-requisite or Prerequisite: FIN 3063.\n\nPrerequisites: MGMT 3103 and at least 90 earned hours.\n\nAs the capstone course in the School of Business core, this course examines the application of strategic management processes, including top management&#39;s role in situational analysis, strategy selection, strategy implementation, and strategic control, under conditions of uncertainty.\n    \n</section>",
